Server init.
>> a := Blob ny: 4.
a bytes: ( Lista ny ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob ny: 4.
b bytes: ( Lista ny ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will retur
>> c := a ny.
{ 
>> n := a ^ c.
Utdata skriv: ['xorred:'], stop. 
Utdata skriv: n, stop. 
} fånga: { :e Utdata skriv: e, stop. }, starta.
a frigör.
b frigör.
